╭ Slash Commands ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│Commands                                                                      │
│❯ /help               Show commands and keyboard shortcuts                    │
│  /clear              Clear the visible transcript                            │
│  /compact            Compact session context into memory                     │
│  /model              Show or select the session model                        │
│  /mode               Cycle or select auto/manual/accept-edits/plan           │
│  /effort             Select low/medium/high/xhigh/max/ultracode              │
│  /permissions        Show the current permission policy                      │
│  /memory             Search durable memory                                   │
│  /pack               Show the bounded MemoryPack                             │
│  /tasks              Show the current task board                             │
│  /plan               Enter plan mode                                         │
│  /status             Show profile/model/context/kernel status                │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
